      "message": "This allows the caller to make arbitrary mutations to the device tree buffer. Isn\u0027t it an invariant of the `Fdt` that the buffer contains a valid device tree, as checked by `from_slice`? If safe code in the caller can use `as_mut_slice` to violate that invariant then the assumptions of the other safe methods (e.g. `header`) are no longer true.",
